{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:12.70.070","page_type":"section"},"citation":"12.70.070","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.070","content_hash":"f0e370ff6821b921135e4561afab4797b309e3f0946a5c751c6905ca0602dd69","heading":"Alcohol and cereal malt beverage consumption.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.070:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.070","text":"(a) Each applicant who intends to allow the sale and/or consumption of alcoholic liquor or cereal malt beverages at a special event shall request approval from the Governing Body pursuant to TMC 9.15.020 .\n(b) Subsection (a) of this section shall not apply if the special event occurs within the boundaries of a common consumption area established pursuant to K.S.A. 41-2659 . (Ord. 20474 § 12, 12-19-23.)\nCross References: City Council – Mayor, Chapter 2.15 TMC.","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"02993da3-cd9c-5b51-a874-dd0b68dd532c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.70.070","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.070","content_hash":"b273359173a38e3ec9f36a547af218398b0c5e066833f550708a3b1c3c2ab152","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.070:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.070:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.070","text":"(a) Each applicant who intends to allow the sale and/or consumption of alcoholic liquor or cereal malt beverages at a special event shall request approval from the Governing Body pursuant to TMC 9.15.020 .","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"6fb8d6a1-1138-5